; R4 - Ridge Racer Type 4 (USA, SLUS-00797)

[60 FPS]
Description = Patches the game to run at 60 FPS.
Author = Original patch by AEONG_AEONG
Type = Gameshark
Activation = EndFrame
OverrideCPUOverclock = 300

; Port of R4 60FPS Widescreen Patch V2(Japanese version only).cht.
; Original patch logic is retained, with USA addresses and displaced instructions.
;
; Key Japanese -> USA references (each resolved independently):
; 800AC3C4 -> 800AC794 : normal timing setting
; 800A6178 -> 800A6548 : VBlank counter
; 800F4A4A -> 800F4E1A : mode index
; 800F3806 -> 800F3BD6 : state index
; 800F4A48 -> 800F4E18 : pause flag
; 800FF490 -> 800FF860 : game mode
; 800F2BC4 -> 800F2F94 : simulation frame counter
; 800AC9FC -> 800ACDCC : current command-buffer pointer
; 800ABCE0 -> 800AC0B0 : player car base
; 80106F78 -> 80107348 : other-car array base
; 800FFA00 -> 800FFDD0 : active car-pointer list
; 80114780 -> 80114A38 : callback path 2
; 80114978 -> 80114C30 : two-player callback
; 801165A8 -> 80116860 : callback path 6
; 80116FE4 -> 8011729C : normal race callback
; 80118248 -> 80118500 : two-player rotation vectors
; 80118268 -> 80118520 : two-player translation vectors

; Frame pacing and callback classification.
; Run the original simulation on normal frames and insert render-only frames.
; Enable interpolation only for recognized callbacks at the normal 0x180 setting.
; Use the VBlank counter, pause state and game mode to reject unsafe interpolation.
